      {
        "id": 138688,
        "name": "silopolis",
        "username": "silopolis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silopolis/{size}/2166_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-15T19:01:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MarioFanaticXV\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mariofanaticxv/48/2129_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MarioFanaticXV:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Matchstickman wrote:</b><br><blockquote>MarioFanaticXV wrote:<br><blockquote>&nbsp;Silverleaf wrote:<br><blockquote>We really should have a dedicated thread for <strong>discussing unlocking variants</strong>, so people can avoid spoilers more easily.&nbsp;&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nThis sort of game doesn't really have spoilers.\n</blockquote>\nYou quote the idea of one in your post! The point is to avoid unlock spoilers so you can find them on your own.New thread started <a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/unlocking-rook-city-variants-spoilers-7206\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Right Here!</a>\n</blockquote></div>\nWhere? No spoilers were mentioned, only mechanics. Spoilers refer to plot details that are meant to be surprises. But because of the plotless nature of the game, spoilers are impossible. If they add a campaign mode in the future (I know there's been rumors/talk of it), then it's quite possible there's going to be spoilers, but as it stands now, they're not even feasible.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Some people consider it spoilers when others reveal the methods for unlocking hidden content, because they enjoy the thrill of the hunt.</p>\n<p>I just want the variants, personally, so I don't care. But some people do. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
