        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-15T19:03:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>silopolis: You will still be able to get the achievements by doing the challenges; you just won't get them automatically. The game remembers the challenge unlock and the code unlock separately.</p><p>MarioFanaticXV: The knowledge of the challenge details can be a spoiler, if you're interested in discovering them yourself. Spoilers do not have to always have to be about plot; hence the oft-seen modifier, \"plot spoiler.\"</p>",
